Forwarding Bright Data's latest public company page, summarized for diligence.

Bright Data describes itself as the world's #1 web data platform, supporting the public data needs of 50,000+ organizations in nearly every industry.
Bright Data says it has +5,500 granted patent claims.
Bright Data was founded in 2014 as Luminati and was acquired by EMK Capital in 2017. Luminati rebranded as Bright Data in 2021.
In 2022, Bright Data reported over 450+ team members.
In 2025, Bright Data's AR surpassed $300M, it had 429B cached web pages, and it served 14 of the top 20 LLM labs.
Or Lenchner is Chief Executive Officer. Ethan Gadon is Chief Financial Officer. Efim Dimenstein is Chief Technology Officer.
Bright Data's founders are Ofer Vilenski and Derry Shribman.

Source: https://brightdata.com/about
